<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/215a02a3-25a1-4cba-9586-e96de9a96183-01/Lot/LOT-0001>
  a epo:Lot;
  epo:foreseesContractSpecificTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/215a02a3-25a1-4cba-9586-e96de9a96183-01/ContractTerm$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1>,
